WEBVTT

00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:32.268
had published highly explicit
sexual commentary about me

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.042
and what they'd like to do to me.

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:38.643
"Cover her face and we'd fuck her body,"

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:40.000
one person wrote.

00:01:40.958 --> 00:01:45.393
They also published
identifying information about me:

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:49.167
where I lived, what I studied, who I was.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.833
But things got worse.

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:56.768
I soon discovered
that these sexual predators

00:01:56.792 --> 00:02:01.976
had doctored or photoshopped my face